cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this reproducibility package, please cite both the archived
  software/data package and the associated manuscript.
title: >-
  Reproducibility package for "Multi-Timescale PTM Architecture in Human
  RNA Polymerase II"
abstract: >-
  Fully reproducible computation of human RNA Polymerase II post-translational
  modification (PTM) information capacity, from raw database downloads to
  every figure, table, and numeric result in the manuscript "Multi-Timescale
  PTM Architecture in Human RNA Polymerase II". The package integrates six
  public PTM databases plus literature-mined entries into a comprehensive
  atlas of human RNA Polymerase II PTMs, then applies information-theoretic
  methods to quantify the information capacity those modifications encode.
